#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Local release artifacts (/release writes them here) and store listing material
# (listing text, screenshots, data-safety answers, release notes).
/dist/
/store/

# Signing is local (docs/RELEASING.md). Neither of these ever gets committed.
android/key.properties
*.jks

# Secrets
.env*
